+/*****************************************************************************
+ * FUNCTION
+ *  hal_btif_info_get
+ * DESCRIPTION
+ *  get btif's information included base address , irq related information
+ * PARAMETERS
+ * RETURNS
+ *  BTIF's information
+ *****************************************************************************/
