+ * CREG | Check temp register ID (#) | W(1) | AP Physical address        | offset | value
+ * CREG | Check temp register ID (#) | W(1) | AP Physical address        | offset | value
+ * CREG | Check temp register ID (#) | W(1) | AP Physical address        | offset | value | mask
+ * CREG | Check temp register ID (#) | W(1) | AP Physical address        | offset | value | mask
